slation/run_tests.sh` rebuilds C + Rust, diffs `nm -D`, and runs the suite across profiles × feature combos. Cargo.toml declares no `[features]`, so combos are default and `--no-default-features`, each in release and debug: **4/4 configurations, symbol diff empty each time, 29/29 tests passing, 0 warnings**.\n\nNote: `cargo` has no network here, so builds/tests use `--offline` (`libloading 0.8.9` was already in the local registry cache). Nothing in `c_src/` was modified; only `c_src/build/` was created by the prescribed cmake step."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1044,"cache_read_input_tokens":69279,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1044,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5abbd804-8082-4645-8862-d89429a1dd1a","uuid":"cc2d16ae-9709-4beb-bb35-3f162f612789","timestamp":"2026-09-05T00:05:06.276Z"}
